  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy Support to CSO Development in Ukraine, 2019-2024 - Consultancy Support to CSO Development in Ukraine-NEW</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultst&#xf6;d till utveckling av civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer i Ukraina, 2019-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Ukraina planerar att forts&#xe4;tta st&#xf6;dja civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer (CSO:er) f&#xf6;r att de ska bli h&#xe5;llbara, ha stark ledning och kapacitet att fr&#xe4;mja f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar och reformer i Ukraina. Det tidigare konsultkontraktet har l&#xf6;pt ut, och ambassaden i Kiev skulle vilja upphandla en ny konsult med s&#xe4;rskild expertis inom institutionell utveckling av CSO:er.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Embassy in Ukraine is keen to continue to support civil society organisations (CSOs) to become sustainable, well-managed and capacitated to promote changes and reforms in Ukraine. The previous consultancy contract has expired and the Embassy in Kyiv would like to procure a new consultancy with a special expertise in organizational/institutional development area of CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the contracted consultancy is helping to implement the Support to the Civil Society in Ukraine Programme by: undertaking system-based audits of CSOs coupled with capacity development work, while providing mentoring, training and coaching services to the Ukrainian programme- and project-supported NGOs to facilitate their strategies implementation and result-based management.

Besides, the consultancy is engaged in spearheading Swedish perspectives and development effectiveness - namely, the overarching poor peoples perspectives, the rights perspective, as well as the thematic perspectives of environment and climate, gender equality, and conflict.

The assignment pursues consultancy services in the areas of organizational effectiveness, organizational development, capacity enhancement, monitoring and evaluation, and implementation follow-up for the Embassys partner CSOs (both current and prospective) along the lines of these objectives:

- Pre-selection and verification;
- Implementation follow-up, mentorship and advisory support; 
- Perspectives to mainstream development effectiveness; 
- Monitoring and evaluation;
- Other specific task/s aimed at networking, sharing of NGO good practices, peer exchange, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
